[?2004l===== notes/forms.txt =====
Event descriptions use NAME then FIELD lines. Ledger is name|relpath|field:kind,... .
KDEC files start with KDEC1. Decode JSON uses kind decoded or unknown.
Decode fields object keys are the FIELD names from that description (for example latch, force, amp, bit, thick, mm, q, n, w).
===== notes/layout.txt =====
evd holds descriptions. intake/current.ledger is the mill roster. emitters hold kdec tables.
frames hold packed samples. forgekit is the C pipeline.
===== notes/ops.txt =====
After adding a description, the first mill may still leave decode unknown until the intake sheet matches what discovery wrote.
Unknown decode is normal for frames that have no description on this bench.
